# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Backend .dockerignore - Optimized for .NET builds
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ─── Build Artifacts ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/out/
**/publish/

# ─── IDE & Editor Files ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/*.user
**/*.suo
**/*.userosscache
**/*.sln.docstates
**/.DS_Store

# ─── Configuration & Secrets ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Exclude all appsettings except Example
**/appsettings.*.json
!**/appsettings.Example.json
**/*.Development.json
**/*.Local.json
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# ─── Logs & Temporary Files ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/logs/
**/*.log
**/tmp/
**/temp/

# ─── Version Control ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/.git/
**/.gitignore
**/.gitattributes

# ─── Package Management ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/packages/
**/.nuget/

# ─── Testing & Coverage ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/TestResults/
**/coverage/
**/*.trx

# ─── Documentation ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/*.md
!**/README.md

# ─── Docker Files ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/.dockerignore
**/Dockerfile
**/docker-compose*.yml

# ─── Other Services (if building single service) ──────────────────────────────
# Uncomment if you want to exclude other services when building individually
# services/GmailManager.Auth/
# services/GmailManager.Email/
# services/GmailManager.Analytics/
# services/GmailManager.Notification/
